# Normalize markdown content to LF on commit, defense-in-depth for the frontmatter
# reference rewriter's CRLF handling. The rewriter preserves CRLF byte for byte, so this
# keeps the corpus uniform rather than relying on it.
*.md text eol=lf

# The initial split commit accidentally committed this file with literal control bytes in a
# regex character class instead of escape sequences, so git's binary heuristic treats every
# diff against that blob as binary. Force a textual diff so later fixes stay reviewable.
src/lib/sveltekit/content-routes-media-shared.ts diff
